# 🔥 PRO LEVEL QUESTIONS (RARE BUT POWERFUL)

---

## ⭐ 28) How do you prevent cheating or fake responses?

**Answer**

> I can track response time and analyze patterns to detect anomalies.
> 
> 
> In future, I can integrate proctoring features like webcam monitoring or tab switching detection.
> 

---

## ⭐ 29) How do you handle memory leaks in React?

**Answer**

> I clean up side effects using `useEffect` cleanup functions.
> 
> 
> For example, clearing timers, aborting API calls, and stopping speech recognition when components unmount.
> 

---

## ⭐ 30) How do you optimize re-renders?

**Answer**

> I use memoization techniques like `React.memo`, `useMemo`, and `useCallback`.
> 
> 
> I also structure state properly to avoid unnecessary updates.
>